</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/e19e3780-cece-11f1-ac1d-4d317af013fd/w:1024/p:16x9/capture-b1b4d7b1.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/e19e3780-cece-11f1-ac1d-4d317af013fd/w:1024/p:16x9/capture-b1b4d7b1.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">0d941502-ce53-11f1-8829-9954973363d7</guid><pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 19:59:12 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>François PICARD</dc:creator></item></channel></rss>
